{"unit_id": "tag:07R0:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）的正则轨迹（regular locus）对泛化（generalizations）封闭，见《代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0001>之前的讨论。然而，对于一般的局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（schemes），正则轨迹（regular locus）未必是开（open）的。《更多代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0002>节给出了一些判定何时如此的准则。我们将在《态射（Morphisms）》第<REF_0003>节进一步讨论这一点。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则轨迹"}, {"source_term": "generalizations", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则轨迹"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "概形的局部诺特性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "局部诺特性质所修饰的对象"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则轨迹", "context": "由局部环为正则的点组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "generalizations", "target_term": "泛化", "context": "与特化相反的关系"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引定义所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "此处修饰一般情形下的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "一般情形所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "regular locus", "target_term": "正则轨迹", "context": "此处讨论它是否为开集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "正则轨迹未必具有的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引续篇章名中的学科名"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "后续讨论所在的章名"}], "notes": []}
