{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ1:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n回顾一下，我们在《更多代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0001>节引入了（几何（geometrically））单支（unibranch）局部环（local ring）的概念。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "geometrically", "target_term": "几何"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引续篇章名中的学科名"}, {"source_term": "geometrically", "target_term": "几何", "context": "区分单支与几何单支的可选修饰语"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支", "context": "此处是局部环的性质"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "所引概念适用的环"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ2:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。称<MATH_0003><TEXTITOPEN_0001>单支于（unibranch at）<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，其条件是局部环（local ring）<MATH_0005>是单支（unibranch）的。称<MATH_0006><TEXTITOPEN_0002>几何单支于（geometrically unibranch at）<MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，其条件是局部环（local ring）<MATH_0008>是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的。称<MATH_0009>是<TEXTITOPEN_0003>单支（unibranch）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>的，其条件是<MATH_0010>单支于（unibranch at）其所有的点（points）。称<MATH_0011>是<TEXTITOPEN_0004>几何单支（geometrically unibranch）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>的，其条件是<MATH_0012>几何单支于（geometrically unibranch at）其所有的点（points）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "unibranch at", "target_term": "单支于"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch at", "target_term": "几何单支于"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支"}, {"source_term": "unibranch at", "target_term": "单支于"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch at", "target_term": "几何单支于"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本定义所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "unibranch at", "target_term": "单支于", "context": "概形在指定点处的性质"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "用来定义在给定点处单支的环"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支", "context": "局部环的性质"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch at", "target_term": "几何单支于", "context": "概形在指定点处的几何单支性质"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "用来定义在给定点处几何单支的环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "局部环的几何单支性质"}, {"source_term": "unibranch", "target_term": "单支", "context": "概形处处单支时的整体性质"}, {"source_term": "unibranch at", "target_term": "单支于", "context": "对概形各点逐点要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形的全称量化对象"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "概形处处几何单支时的整体性质"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch at", "target_term": "几何单支于", "context": "对概形各点逐点要求的性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "概形的全称量化对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ1:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n确实可能出现这样的情形：局部环（local ring）<MATH_0001>是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的（按《更多代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0001>的意义），但概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>并非定义<REF_0002>意义下的几何单支（geometrically unibranch）。例如，若<MATH_0003>是某条具有普通二重点奇性（ordinary double point singularity）（即结点（node））的不可约（irreducible）平面曲线（plane curve）之上的锥（cone）的顶点（vertex）处的局部环（local ring），就会出现这种情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "ordinary double point singularity", "target_term": "普通二重点奇性"}, {"source_term": "node", "target_term": "结点"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "plane curve", "target_term": "平面曲线"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥"}, {"source_term": "vertex", "target_term": "顶点"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "开头所讨论的环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "局部环的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引续篇章名中的学科名"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "与前述局部环相联系的对象"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "被否定的概形整体性质"}, {"source_term": "ordinary double point singularity", "target_term": "普通二重点奇性", "context": "示例中曲线的奇性类型"}, {"source_term": "node", "target_term": "结点", "context": "普通二重点的别称"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约", "context": "修饰例中的平面曲线"}, {"source_term": "plane curve", "target_term": "平面曲线", "context": "用来构造锥的曲线"}, {"source_term": "cone", "target_term": "锥", "context": "由平面曲线构造的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "vertex", "target_term": "顶点", "context": "所