{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ3:statement", "translation": "正规（normal）概形（scheme）是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "作为引理假设的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "引理所得的概形性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ3:proof", "translation": "结论由定义得出。具体而言，概形（scheme）是正规（normal）的，如果它的局部环（local rings）都是正规（normal）整环（domains）。由《更多代数（Algebra）》定义<REF_0001>直接可知，局部正规整环（local normal domain）是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规"}, {"source_term": "domains", "target_term": "整环"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "local normal domain", "target_term": "局部正规整环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "正规性所针对的对象"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "概形的性质"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "用来判定概形正规性的环"}, {"source_term": "normal", "target_term": "正规", "context": "修饰局部整环"}, {"source_term": "domains", "target_term": "整环", "context": "正规概形的局部环所属的环类"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引续篇章名中的学科名"}, {"source_term": "local normal domain", "target_term": "局部正规整环", "context": "所用结论适用的环"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "局部正规整环的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ4:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为诺特概形（Noetherian scheme）。下列条件等价（equivalent）\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的（定义<REF_0001>）；\n<STRUCT_0003> 对于每个点（point）<MATH_0003>，若它不是不可约分支（irreducible component）的泛点（generic point）（这里指<MATH_0004>的不可约分支），则严格（strict）亨泽尔化（henselization）<MATH_0005>的去点谱（punctured spectrum）是连通（connected）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "irreducible component", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "henselization", "target_term": "亨泽尔化"}, {"source_term": "punctured spectrum", "target_term": "去点谱"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Noetherian scheme", "target_term": "诺特概形", "context": "引理的假设"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "联系两条条件"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支", "context": "第一条条件"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "第二条条件的量化对象"}, {"source_term": "irreducible component", "target_term": "不可约分支", "context": "其泛点须排除的分支"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "第二条条件排除的点"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格", "context": "区分两类亨泽尔化"}, {"source_term": "henselization", "target_term": "亨泽尔化", "context": "用以取谱的环构造"}, {"source_term": "punctured spectrum", "target_term": "去点谱", "context": "第二条条件要求连通的空间"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通", "context": "第二条条件要求的拓扑性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0BQ4:proof", "translation": "《更多代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>表明，由（1）可知（2）中的去点谱（punctured spectra）均不可约（irreducible），特别地，它们均连通（connected）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设（2）。设<MATH_0001>。我们需要证明<MATH_0002>是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的。对<MATH_0003>作归纳，可假设结论对<MATH_0004>的每个非平凡泛化（nontrivial generalization）均成立。可以将<MATH_0005>替换为<MATH_0006>。换言之，可以假设<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>是局部（local）的，并且<MATH_0009>是几何单支（geometrically unibranch）的，这对每个非极大素理想（nonmaximal prime）<MATH_0010>均成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n设<MATH_0011>为下列环的严格（strict）亨泽尔化（henselization）：<MATH_0012>。若<MATH_0013>是位于<MATH_0014>上方的素理想（prime），则<MATH_0015>是一个滤过余极限（filtered colimit），对应的图由平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）代数（algebras）组成。因此，严格（strict）亨泽尔化（henselizations）所得的两个环（分别对应<MATH_0016>和<MATH_0017>）同构（isomorphic）。于是由《更多代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>可知，<MATH_0018>有唯一的极小素（minimal prime）理想（ideal），这一结论对每个非极大素理想（nonmaximal prime）<MATH_0019>（属于<MATH_0020>）均成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n设<MATH_0021>为极小素理想（minimal primes），这些理想属于<MATH_0022>。我们需要证明<MATH_0023>。由上可知，<MATH_0024>对<MATH_0025>成立。因此<MATH_0026>是一个开（open）的闭子集（closed subset），所处空间为<MATH_0027>的去点谱（punctured spectrum）。这与该去点谱（punctured spectrum）连通（connected）的假设矛盾，除非<MATH_0028>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "punctured spectra", "target_term": "去点谱"}, {"source_term": "irreducible", "target_term": "不可约"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "nontrivial generalization", "target_term": "非平凡泛化"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "geometrically unibranch", "target_term": "几何单支"}, {"source_term": "nonmaximal prime", "target_term": "非极大素理想"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "henselization", "target_term": "亨泽尔化"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素理想"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "éta