{"unit_id": "tag:01PA:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。下面的引理表明，<MATH_0004>是有限型（finite type）的（见《模（Modules）》定义<REF_0001>），当且仅当<MATH_0005>在每个仿射（affine）开集（open）<MATH_0006>上具有形式<MATH_0007>，其中取某个有限（finite）的<MATH_0008>-模（module）<MATH_0009>。同样，<MATH_0010>具有有限表示（finite presentation）（见《模（Modules）》定义<REF_0002>），当且仅当<MATH_0011>在每个仿射（affine）开集（open）<MATH_0012>上具有形式<MATH_0013>，其中取某个具有有限表示（finitely presented）的<MATH_0014>-模（module）<MATH_0015>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给模的底空间"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "所给模的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "给定的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第一条等价关系的性质"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一条定义所在的章名"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "限定第一条条件中所用的开集"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "第一条条件的量化对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "第一条局部刻画中代数模的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "