{"unit_id": "tag:01PB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。由<MATH_0002>-模（modules）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0003>是有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0004>-模（module），当且仅当<MATH_0005>是有限（finite）的<MATH_0006>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "引理的底空间"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "该拟凝聚层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "引理中待判定为有限型的层"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "层一侧的条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "层一侧的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "代数模一侧的条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "代数一侧的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PB:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0002>-模（module）。这意味着存在<MATH_0003>的一个开（open）覆盖（covering），使得<MATH_0004>在该覆盖（covering）的各成员上的限制（restricted）均由有限多个截面（sections）整体生成（globally generated）。因此还存在一个标准开（standard open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>由有限多个截面（sections）生成（generated）。这样，<MATH_0007>是有限生成（finitely generated）的，这对每个<MATH_0008>均成立。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>即得结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "整体生成"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "证明中的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "被假定为有限型的对象"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "所取覆盖的类型"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "由有限型条件得到的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "作限制时所用的覆盖"}, {"source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制", "context": "将模层置于覆盖成员上"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "整体生成模层所用的元素"}, {"source_term": "globally generated", "target_term": "整体生成", "context": "在覆盖成员上成立的生成性质"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开", "context": "限制所选开覆盖的成员"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "进一步所选的标准开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "在标准开覆盖上进行生成的元素"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "截面对相应对象的生成关系"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成", "context": "应用所引引理之前取得的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "最后所引的引理所在的章名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为仿射概形（affine scheme）。由<MATH_0002>-模（modules）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0003>是具有有限表示（finite presentation）的<MATH_0004>-模（module），当且仅当<MATH_0005>是具有有限表示（finite presentation）的<MATH_0006>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "引理的底空间"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "该拟凝聚层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "引理所刻画的层"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "层一侧的条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "层一侧的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "代数模一侧的条件"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "代数模一侧的对象"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01PC:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是具有有限表示（finite presentation）的<MATH_0002>-模（module）。由引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）的<MATH_0004>-模（module）。选取满射（surjection）<MATH_0005>，其核（kernel）为<MATH_0006>。由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>，有短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0007>\n由《模（Modules）》引理<REF_0003>可知，<MATH_0008>是有限型（finite type）的<MATH_0009>-模（module）。于是再次应用引理<REF_0004>可知，<MATH_0010>是有限（finite）的<MATH_0011>-模（module）。因此<MATH_0012>是具有有限表示（finite presentation）的<MATH_0013>-模（module）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "对证明起点所取的模的假设"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "所假定具有有限表示的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "由前一引理推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "第一个由引理推出为有限的对象"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射", "context": "证明中带有指定核的映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核", "context": "所选满射的核"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "短正合列所据引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列", "context": "此处由概形章的引理得出的列"}, {"source_term": "Modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "有限型结论所据引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "此处由模章引理取得的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "在此次应用中为有限型的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "再次应用引理得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "此次得到为有限的对象"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "证明最终推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "最终取得有限表示的对象"}], "notes": []}
