{"unit_id": "tag:01P7:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。记<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>可逆（invertible）的开集（open），见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。若<MATH_0005>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的，则典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0006>\n是同构（isomorphism）。此外，若<MATH_0007>是由<MATH_0008>-模（modules）组成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），则映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>\n是同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所取的底空间"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定开集的条件"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "由可逆性条件指定的子集"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "可逆处开集所据引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "第一项同构所需的假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "第一项同构所需的另一假设"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "第一项结论涉及的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "对典范映射所得的结论"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所取拟凝聚层的取值对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "第二项结论所加的假设"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第二项结论涉及的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "对第二个映射所得的结论"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01P7:proof", "translation": "记<MATH_0001>。考虑概形（schemes）的典范态射（canonical morphism）\n<MATH_0002>\n见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>。于是，右边的标准开集（standard open）<MATH_0003>的逆（inverse）像（image）是左边的<MATH_0004>。此外，由于假设<MATH_0005>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>也拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），见《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>。因此，由《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0004>可知，<MATH_0007>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。由此可知<MATH_0008>，其中将<MATH_0009>视为<MATH_0010>-模（module）。于是得到\n<MATH_0011>\n这恰是该引理的内容。该引理所列的第一个同构（isomorphism）可通过取<MATH_0012>得到。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所取态射的两端所属的对象"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "证明所考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给出典范态射的引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "standard open", "target_term": "标准开集", "context": "取逆像时右边的开集"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与像合成逆像一词"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "与逆合成对应于左边开集的术语"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指定对象的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "指定对象的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "继承相关性质的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "该态射所得的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "该态射所得的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射性质所据两条引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "拟凝聚性所据引理所在章名"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "由上述态射性质推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "解释所列对象时采用的结构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明如何取得的第一项结论"}], "notes": []}
